{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13218290","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13218290","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1321829001:1":{"text":"Ludovic? What brought him here?","source_cn":"柳博米尔来过？他找你有什么事情？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35E7ED2337E364DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321829002:1":{"text":"He gave me a bouquet of flowers and asked me to place them at my parents' grave... Then he said something that I didn't quite understand.","source_cn":"那个哥哥清晨很早就来了。他给了我一束花，让我放在我爸爸...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x910AF7642E10670C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321829003:1":{"text":"What did he say?","source_cn":"他说了什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD90F1309A6A9F2D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321829004:1":{"text":"Let me think... He talked about how fragile life is... Oh, and something about the everblooms... What else...","source_cn":"让我想想……他说了生命脆弱什么的……哦，对了，还说了永...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00B7E685835BECE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321829005:2":{"text":"Your parents' funeral is today, isn't it?","source_cn":"你父母的葬礼是今天，对吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3D946590ECCF885","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321829006:1":{"text":"Yes... Would you like to attend it?","source_cn":"嗯……小哥哥，你也要来参加吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C54E5BE101CE730","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321829007:1":{"text":"No... I was simply struck by a thought. I had believed Yolena's funeral would be the last of our family's.","source_cn":"不，我只是很感慨……我曾以为亚莲娜的葬礼是我经历的最后...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F6FA530AD01F4D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321829008:1":{"text":"Life is fragile. Months pass like mere moments against the span of my existence, yet in that fleeting time, I have witnessed both the fading and rebirth of the Valesa name.","source_cn":"生命是如此脆弱。几个月的时光，和无尽的永生相比来说是那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6626789DDEE5AC50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321829009:0":{"text":"Fate is cruel, unpredictable, and perhaps... even merciful. Please take this bouquet, Orla.","source_cn":"命运是无情的，是莫测的，或许……也是仁慈的。请收下这束...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48CC585E825A5903","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:13::0":{"text":"Everbloom Bouquet","source_cn":"永寂花束","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2D81D9121ADC71E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321829010:1":{"text":"These flowers are...","source_cn":"这束花是……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x851B8B97B3BBED86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321829011:0":{"text":"Everblooms, flowers for the deceased. Please place the bouquet on your parents' grave. Let the flowers be the witness of yet another farewell in this world.","source_cn":"永寂花，献给死者之花，请把它放在你父母的坟墓上吧。就让...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AB93644EBC8E29C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321829012:0":{"text":"Please let Mr. Faramor know that I'd like to speak with him after the funeral. I'll be waiting for you on the <style=\"highlight\">outskirts of town</style>.","source_cn":"我会在<style=highlight>雪松镇外</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8E1F331A19080F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1321829013:2":{"text":"I've got it. Orla, let's attend your parents' funeral first. I'll meet him afterward.","source_cn":"我明白了。奥尔嘉，我们先去参加你父母的葬礼吧。葬礼结束...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5427903BDFB3D948","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:法拉莫尔":{"text":"Faramor","source":"法拉莫尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奥尔嘉":{"text":"Orla","source":"奥尔嘉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:柳博米尔":{"text":"Ludovic","source":"柳博米尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":3}}